{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-24T04:31:55.745Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"81b105e64821e6c8658953ed","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-24T04:31:55.745Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-24T04:31:55.745Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"The full baseline after pinning pm-cli 2026.11.23, pm-changelog 2026.11.20 and pm-ops 2026.11.22 passed 373 of 376 tests. Build and test typecheck passed.\n\n- The ownership property and seed normalization tests passed an undeclared seed flag to setup aliases. The host now rejects the flag with `unknown_option` before dispatch. Use `presets apply --with-seeds` for enrollment and exercise aliases with their declared flags on settings, templates and enrolled seeds. Explicit seed enrollment through an alias still refuses without changing tracker bytes.\n- The no-git upgrade flow imported old private SDK files. The installed package now maps its public SDK entry points to bundled files. Resolve those public exports before running the child without Git and preserve plan, retry and rollback checks.\n\nRestoring the old fixture dispatch and imports reproduced all three failures in a disposable copy. The focused ownership/workflow tests passed 22/22 and the two other named regressions passed 2/2. Both linked test commands passed in a disposable tracker.\n\n`npm run release:check` at full depth and `PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick bun run release:check` each passed 377/377 with zero skips, failures or cancellations. Both measured 100% lines, branches and functions across all 36 configured files. The fresh build matched committed dist. The changelog regenerated byte for byte with all 70 published dependency bullets, and removing the flag from any of its five entry points failed the existing retention test. Changelog and strict tracker health checks passed. The host behaviours match the installed SDK contracts."}]}],"before_hash":"11c97502d38889261ac6ff6b8f89e275dddd98b267f87543e266fb97a188cb38","after_hash":"fd200d1d62cc6f941ae92b16bda4e5b9b0912c70845516f305b00d3944a58012","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"9a149deec9f8e9038a8ff317f86b2a93245944aaf9531bde14d9fcf457bc849d"}
